os]; i != -1; i = nxt[i]) {\n                if (!vis[v[i]] && w[i] > 0 && dis[v[i]] == dis[pos] + c[i]) {\n                    cur[pos] = i;\n                    long fl = dfs(v[i], Math.min(flow, w[i]));\n                    cost += fl * c[i];\n                    w[i] -= fl;\n                    w[i ^ 1] += fl;\n                    flow -= fl;\n                    if (flow == 0) break;\n                }\n            }\n            return tmp - flow;\n        }\n\n        public FlowGraph() {\n            Arrays.fill(head, -1);\n            Arrays.fill(nxt, -1);\n        }\n\n        public void addEdge(int uu, int vv, long ww, int cc) {\n            paddEdge(uu, vv, ww, cc);\n            paddEdge(vv, uu, 0, -cc);\n        }\n\n        public long dinic(int s, int t) {\n            cost = 0;\n            this.t = t;\n            while (spfa(s, t)) {\n                Arrays.fill(cur, -1);\n                dfs(s, Long.MAX_VALUE);\n            }\n            return cost;\n        }\n    }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) throws IOException {\n        BufferedReader in = new BufferedReader(new InputStreamReader(System.in));\n        PrintWriter out = new PrintWriter(System.out);\n        String[] line = in.readLine().split(\" \");\n        int n = Integer.parseInt(line[0]);\n        int m = Integer.parseInt(line[1]);\n        int kk = Integer.parseInt(line[2]);\n        int c = Integer.parseInt(line[3]);\n        int d = Integer.parseInt(line[4]);\n        int[] a = new int[kk + 1];\n        line = in.readLine().split(\" \");\n        for (int i = 1; i <= kk; i++) {\n            a[i] = Integer.parseInt(line[i - 1]);\n        }\n        FlowGraph g = new FlowGraph();\n        int s = 0;\n        int t = n * 100 + 1;\n        for (int i = 1; i <= 100; i++) {\n            g.addEdge(i, t, Long.MAX_VALUE, 0);\n        }\n        for (int i = 1; i <= kk; i++) {\n            g.addEdge(s, (a[i] - 1) * 100 + 1, 1, 0);\n        }\n        for (int i = 2; i <= n; i++) {\n            for (int j = 1; j < 100; j++) {\n                g.addEdge((i - 1) * 100 + j, (i - 1) * 100 + j + 1, Long.MAX_VALUE, c);\n            }\n        }\n        for (int _ = 1; _ <= m; _++) {\n            line = in.readLine().split(\" \");\n            int t1 = Integer.parseInt(line[0]);\n            int t2 = Integer.parseInt(line[1]);\n            for (int i = 1; i < 100; i++) {\n                for (int j = 1; j <= kk; j++) {\n                    int val = c + d * (j * j - (j - 1) * (j - 1));\n                    g.addEdge((t1 - 1) * 100 + i, (t2 - 1) * 100 + i + 1, 1, val);\n                    g.addEdge((t2 - 1) * 100 + i, (t1 - 1) * 100 + i + 1, 1, val);\n                }\n            }\n        }\n        out.println(g.dinic(s, t));\n        out.close();\n    }\n}\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.95\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-0.1296914517879486, -0.010019500739872456, -0.03941745311021805, -0.011861056089401245, -0.00016547618724871427, -0.3488149642944336, -0.723595380783081, -0.00023266399512067437, -1.2517053619376384e-05, -1.0132840543519706e-05, -9.89442014542874e-06, -0.16297249495983124, -7.152560215217818e-07, -5.483642325998517e-06, -7.74863383412594e-06, -3.218656047465629e-06, -0.016048310324549675, -4.589663149090484e-05, -0.00012493913527578115, -1.2755474926962052e-05, -0.3497801423072815, -0.0168903898447752, -0.0009122478077188134, -0.0007366866921074688, -0.00010049848060589284, -0.004028077702969313, -0.9647952914237976, -8.583106136939023e-06, -0.0015043601160869002, -8.464217535220087e-05, -5.4480129620060325e-05, -1.1920935776288388e-06, -0.9321709871292114, -0.17974725365638733, -0.0020835036411881447, -0.00010467123502166942, -9.059946933120955e-06, -0.502842903137207, -0.3132655918598175, -0.019587794318795204, -4.2439409298822284e-05, -0.11681615561246872, -0.497280091047287, -0.07250210642814636, -0.0795556902885437, -0.24578727781772614, -0.5734195709228516, -0.0021264497190713882, -0.016269531100988388, 